  NOTIFICATIONS -.->|"Domain Events"| MAINTENANCE
  INSPECTIONS <-->|"Re-inspection Events"| MAINTENANCE
  DASHBOARD --> ASSETS
  DASHBOARD --> INSPECTIONS
  DASHBOARD --> MAINTENANCE
  USERS --> SHARED
  CONTRACTS --> SHARED
  ASSETS --> SHARED
  INSPECTIONS --> SHARED
  MAINTENANCE --> SHARED
  NOTIFICATIONS --> SHARED
